<!--
    Adaptive-icon background layer. Solid brand-brown — matches the dark
    corner colour of the foreground so the launcher's circle / squircle
    mask blends cleanly with the gold-on-brown rounded square baked into
    ic_launcher_foreground.png. Colour from the icon spec's palette
    (#1A120B "fondo oscuro").
-->
